{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_nblade_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_nblade_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "授刀",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_nblade_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "895c55ce8b392c8ec6187e18f54e868f36e2e916097bab2300d99aec3a9b4d4f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "前輩......夜刀前輩好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "......你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "等等。你，等一下，你認識我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "是、是的。我研究過A4行動組的作戰案例......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "哦，你叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "我叫曼迪，前輩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "以前沒見過你......才入職不久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "是的！我是三月過來的，通過了外勤幹員的考核，目前正在學習近衛幹員的課程中！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "近衛......你會用刀嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "學過一點，您問這個——\n啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "接著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "這把刀......是您隨身的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "拿著，就用它和我打一場，看看你的實力如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "嗚哇？！這——怎麼能？我還完全達不到和您交手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "不必妄自菲薄，你發揮全部實力就好，我自有判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "夜刀，等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "巡林者老爺子，既然你在，就幫我看著......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "夜刀，別逗小孩子玩了，他們一會兒還要去上課呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "好吧......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "沒關係。那兩位前輩，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "好啦好啦，你忙你的去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我說夜刀，這幾天老看你在找那些新人。你那身手就放過年輕人啦，他們還不夠你兩下子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "是嗎？我記得我剛來羅德島的時候，沒有那麼弱......至少和前輩交手兩下不在話下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "那都是很久之前了，那會也沒這麼多人，都是進來就工作的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "時代變了，現在流行的是培養新人，打好他們的基礎，然後是怎麼說來著......哦對，幫助他們融入職場環境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "他們還有兩人三足滑冰賽玩，真令老夫羡慕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "原來如此，我不是很清楚現在的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "這也沒什麼要特別瞭解的。汽水，夜刀要來一罐嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "（接住）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "但話又說回來，這些年輕人能通過幹員考核，肯定也是不簡單的，和我們不過就是差些實戰經驗，很快就能趕上來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "前輩，年輕人中有戰鬥技巧比較出色的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "戰鬥......這方面老夫沒有去瞭解過，可以幫你去問問。怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "......你知道，我的刀壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "哦，老夫想起來了，是在砍磐蟹那時候吧，你還找黑角要了備用刀來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "再去後勤部領一把，或者找火神小姐定製一把新武器，她肯定樂意幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "難不成夜刀是想收徒，把舊刀當作信物傳下去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "老夫說著玩的，哈哈哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "哈、哈......不會吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我原有這樣的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "可是，夜刀......這沒意義啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我知道......我既不是教官，也不懂如何教導他們。何況我也不知道他們是不是需要這把刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "算了，沒事。我自己再思索一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "夜刀......很少見到她這樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "這把刀......考慮到它的服役時間和維修次數，修復到能夠使用的程度是不可能了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "申請設備報廢後有兩個選擇：向後勤部申請制式佩刀，或者有特殊需要找我定製。都是上系統填個表就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "不過看起來這把刀對你有特殊的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "這是我來到羅德島後拿到的第一把刀，我在東國時佩刀的碎片被熔鑄進其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "被重熔過......原來如此，難怪這把刀在強度上有所不足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "再之前，碎開的那把刀是我以前的劍術師傅留下的，交到了我手上。刀就是這樣被留下來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "說來奇怪，我已經離開故地很久了，但現在再端詳這把刀時卻想起了這段歷史，直到現在......才想要將它留下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "的確不是個好時機，所以你會很糾結要怎麼處置這把武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "好吧，我尊重你的習慣，但是我還是得說，一時半會你很難了結心願，收徒贈刀並不是簡單的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "更何況它是一把用不了的刀，想不到羅德島上有誰會想要它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "說實話，我以前沒想過會有這麼一天。我原以為它會堅持得比我更久，最差的結局也是在戰場上折斷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你說得對......我是不是該趁早打消這個念頭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "唔，如果你還想繼續使用它的話，我還有一個辦法，不過也是老法子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "將這把刀繼續熔鑄成新刀，不過這麼一來，刀體的強度又會再次下降，會更加容易損壞。我不會建議你在高強度的戰鬥中使用它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "要怎麼做，你自己做決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "明白了......我需要再考慮一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "又分心了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你......夜刀，你怎麼竟被一把刀挑得心神不寧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "打擾了，夜刀前輩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "......你找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我叫席琳，席琳·弗里曼。正在外勤部實習，目標是成為一名能擔當先鋒職責的幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "找我有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（深呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "抱歉，我無意間聽到了您和巡林者前輩的對話，您正在尋找交戰的對象。我想......我想與您交手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你想和我打一場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "嗯，沒錯......我想要贏得向您學習的資格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "席琳她......竟然去找夜刀前輩了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她不會這麼快就忘記找上炎客前輩的後果了吧？自從劍術課的測試失誤了以後，她就一直在胡來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她都快要把“證明自己”寫在臉上了，真是不服輸的性子。聽說夜刀前輩一向直來直往，應該不會答應她的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我會注意招式的分寸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "沒必要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "那好......得罪了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（躲、躲開了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "後面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（速度很快，但我能跟得上......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "呵哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你看清了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "沒......沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "夜刀前輩的刀......是什麼時候架在席琳脖子上的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "前輩，我......我想再試一次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "......來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（剛才那招不行，這招或許......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "呵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "唔......你又輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（怎麼會？我明明躲開了她的招式，她應該擊空了才對！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（這把刀......又出現在了這裡......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "差不多夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "不，等等......夜刀前輩，請讓我再試一次！最後一次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你不是我的對手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我......這一次我不會輸的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（我知道她的戰鬥方式，就用上次炎客前輩的那招拼一下，一定可以......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "嘿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我......又失敗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "差距......好大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "連刀都被擊飛了，夜刀前輩果然不留情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "刀脫手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你......再跟著教官勤加練習吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜林",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "呼......呼嚕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "照場上的局勢來看，獲勝者是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "......是俺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "連贏三輪牌，你今天手氣倒是不壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "黑角，你出來是不是換了新面具？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "對，之前那個面具在作戰中不是壞了嘛，就送去修了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "哎，不是！俺不是為了換手氣才特地換了新面具！俺才不會幹那種事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "行了行了。老規矩，誰輸了誰來請客，到我了。大家要喝什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "乾馬丁尼，老樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "杜林......算了，給她來杯鮮榨果汁吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "那俺也要鮮榨......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "一份乾馬丁尼，一份鮮榨果汁，兩份生命之水兌香草沙士，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "黑角，被磐蟹追著的時候你不是還叫著“再也受不了這些仙人掌汁了，臨死前一定要再喝一杯生命之水兌香草沙士”，怎麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "在說什麼？生命之水兌香草沙士嗎？我幫你點了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "嘿，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜林",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "呼......奇怪，夜刀也喝酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "夜刀，還在為那把刀的事煩心嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "還行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "俺聽說，你今天在訓練室和一位年輕人交手了，她怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "一般。底子是有，但是進攻太急躁，經驗也不足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "嗐，老夫才走了一會兒，夜刀又打起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "回來後老夫問了下，那名年輕人叫做......呃......席琳，應該是這個名字，已經算是年輕人中不錯的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "要是她進不了夜刀的眼，其他的也就不行了。要承下夜刀的刀，不容易啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "哦，是席琳啊。俺知道她。模擬訓練的時候帶過她一兩回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你覺得她怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "就跟你說的差不多，太急了。她訓練的確是很刻苦，腦子也靈光，但是實戰發揮的時候老是失常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "她性格既內向，又很不服輸，不善於請教別人，總是自己一根筋紮進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "她有一點挺特別的，在和我交手的時候有一招用得很像炎客那傢伙的把式。後來聽到有些人說她也和炎客交手過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "是啊，她是個優點和缺點都很明顯的年輕人，教官都和她說過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "唉，她自己都明白，不過越是遭遇挫折她就越是受打擊，這讓她更著急，反而止步不前了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "真遺憾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "夜刀，你是不是覺得她和以前的你有點像啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "不，一點都不像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "老夫插句嘴啊，有件事老夫一直很好奇，夜刀，除了收徒傳刀是你們那邊的傳統以外，還有什麼其他原因讓你想這麼做嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "其他原因？為什麼這麼問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "哈哈，別怪老夫瞎說，但是我們現在都是雇員，年輕人也算是同事，有專業團隊培養，我們真的沒有特別的必要去做這種事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "火神也和我說了相似的話，我想了想，的確沒有什麼，甚至我寧願他們不需要我這把刀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "早上我還做了一件事，我去人事部詢問了擴充人手的事宜，得到的回覆是目前新人的能力尚未達到進入行動預備組的標準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "之前我們商量的加人的事沒有結果，估計有段時日，工作還得由我們這些人全盤扛住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "這麼長時間都是這麼過來的，老夫不會有什麼怨言，大家也是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我知道，但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "黑角，這次任務回來醫生給你縫了幾針？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "五......不對，六......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "老爺子，你肩上的舊傷都復發三次了，以為我不知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "杜林的睡袋也丟了好幾個。儘管任務的難度越來越大，我確定我們還能撐下去，只是不知道能撐到哪一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我是這麼想這把刀的，能找到個適合的苗子幫到我們的工作，也不完全算是浪費時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "退一萬步講，如果哪天我們不在這裡了，至少這把刀還能留下來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "夜刀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "喂喂，任務都完成了，好不容易聚一次，大家愁眉苦臉的做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "酒來了，喝，一起喝一杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "來來，喝一杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "乾杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "那個......抱歉打擾各位前輩的興致了，我想找夜刀前輩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你是......早上的實習幹員......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "曼迪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "啊對，是你，我想起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "害怕什麼呀，直說就好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "是這樣的！早上我見到了您和席琳的交手！我......雖然我現在的戰鬥技巧還遠遠不足，但是我非常想要向您學習。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "學習？向我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "是的！我對您的戰鬥方式非常嚮往......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "抱歉，實話實說，能不能教人這事，我自己還沒想明白，這方面我沒有經驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "欸，俺突然有個法子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "夜刀，要不明天你跟俺一起去做模擬訓練好了！俺們可以打一架，展示給年輕人看！這方面俺可熟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "模擬訓練。你是指......我們在他們面前作戰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "是啊，俺做過好多次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "所以經常找不到你人，就是做這個去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "啊，嘿嘿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "啊......如果能這樣的話，實在是太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "老夫覺得這是個好主意，你也可以體驗一下教人的感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "怎麼樣？夜刀，考慮一下嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "......好吧，那就試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "噓，不要說話，黑角前輩正在講話呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "text": "曼迪！快來這邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "來啦來啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "咳咳......有人沒有聽見，那我就再說一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "今天模擬訓練的特別嘉賓，是俺的組長，夜刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "接下來，俺會和夜刀交手，向你們演示一下A4行動組的戰鬥方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "那麼，夜刀，俺們來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "text": "黑角大哥要和夜刀前輩......我還以為他們只是表演一下而已，他們竟然要來真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "text": "黑角大哥，真的頂得住嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "哈，哈，俺要上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（黑角大哥用上全力了。如果是我的話，會嘗試躲開這一刀，可夜刀前輩......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "（低聲）是要放慢動作，讓他們都能看清嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "（低聲）還要專心，可不要小看俺哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（硬碰硬擋下來了...... 難道這麼做的用意是擋住敵方的刀路？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（他們又拉開距離了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "哈，這次我可要認真起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "吃我這一擊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（夜刀前輩的戰鬥方式很有章法，我應該能預測到......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "哎呀，俺輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（最後一招，夜刀前輩閃開了黑角大哥的攻勢，僅憑腳步的挪移，來到了敵人的側面。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（上一次和我戰鬥時，夜刀前輩同樣一瞬間出現在我身後，很可能也是以這種方式......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "這是一次簡單的遭遇戰對抗，大家都看清楚了吧？沒看清的各位，終端裡有重播嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "好了，接下來的模擬訓練就由俺來做你們的對手......夜刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "欸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "今天的剩餘時間，由我來做各位的對手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "等下，夜刀——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "這麼做有問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "倒不是有問題，但是模擬訓練是有個規矩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "獎勵。俺們模擬訓練都是有獎勵的，要是打贏了你，有什麼獎勵嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "......一招即可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "只要有誰能贏了我一招，我會把全部戰鬥經驗，毫無保留地教給他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "哇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "我！夜刀前輩，我來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "數小時後"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "唉，我沒能撐過兩招。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "text": "你還嘆什麼氣？看看別人，在夜刀前輩手下能撐過兩招已經夠不錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "我都挑戰三次了。看了很多遍錄影，還是沒有搞明白夜刀前輩的戰鬥方式......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "還有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "text": "席琳呢？她竟然沒有去試一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "沒有的話，今天就到這裡結束吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "夜刀前輩，我想試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "（拋出刀）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（夜刀前輩還是一樣的動作，毫無破綻，看不出她會從哪裡出手。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（先做好準備......等她出手。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "讓我先來，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（勉、勉強架住了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（把注意力放在刀上，正面對抗......這種方法果然有效。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（她，她是在和我說話？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我要繼續了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（躲開了......但是有機會！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（被閃開了，她的速度太驚人了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "席琳和夜刀前輩交手三招了？你沒騙我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "甚至還擊了一次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "噓，別吵。注意看，席琳的閃躲動作和夜刀前輩方才的動作有點相似。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "她不僅是在適應夜刀前輩的戰鬥節奏，她真的學到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "慢下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（她在......提醒我？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（好，這幾次攻擊都擋下來了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（大概適應她的進攻節奏了，我一定可以......成功完成反擊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（試試看，用夜刀前輩的那種動作。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "（閃開了，然後像她那樣，最直接地出刀——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "席琳她......擊中夜刀前輩了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "不是吧？！席琳！你真的做到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我！我做到了嗎？我的確擊中了什麼，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "飄下來的......這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "一片布？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "關注刀還是關注對手，是要因戰況而改變的。你仍是著急了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "不過，你學到了。我很開心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我......不......我沒能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "真棒！席琳！你已經做得很好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "text": "席琳，你太厲害了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "（能在這麼短的時間內做到這樣，實在難得，席琳......她或許足夠拿起......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "真厲害啊，這下不得不朝著席琳努力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "text": "是啊，希望還能繼續和夜刀前輩交手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "想遞出刀的手停在刀柄上，夜刀環視場下的幹員們。\n她看見，一雙雙年輕的眼睛，目光緊緊地落在自己身上。\n她突然意識到，在他們眼中留下的正是自己的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "夜刀前輩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "還有事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我......我雖然輸了，但......還有機會再和您交手嗎？我從和您的戰鬥中，真的學到了很多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "我也是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "實習幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "text": "我們也想繼續和夜刀前輩交手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "聽好了，明天我還會來這裡，和大家模擬訓練。黑角，應該沒問題吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "不就是填表申請嘛，包在俺身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "以及，我會帶來一把刀，放在訓練室中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "既然今天無人贏下我，我就做出這個決定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "今後，只要我出現在這裡，所有人都可以拿起這把刀與我戰鬥，我時刻樂意奉陪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "羅德島的新人們，我期待下次見到你們的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "所以，你和年輕人們打了幾場，然後就決定把這把刀熔掉了，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "可以這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "你是想好把刀送給哪位看上的年輕人嗎？不對......那樣你根本就沒有必要熔鑄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "嗯，因為這把刀仍會參與戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "char_163_hpsts",
      "text": "那我去燒爐子了，你要記住我的提醒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "“不要在高強度的戰鬥中使用”，我當然記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "從此以後，它會被留下來，只會參與一場戰鬥，被不同的手揮動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "直到遙遠的將來，直到......也許我們都不在的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她注視著那把刀在如驕陽般紅豔的鍛爐中，緩緩下沉，逐漸熔化。\n最終，刀的形體已不復存在，只剩下一團灼紅的液體。\n猶如新血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
